  "notes": [
    {
      "section": "功能介绍",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-cloudhost-uploadversion-0000001211707813#section15494260",
      "text": "通过获取上传地址的响应请求地址、请求方法、请求头信息，上传版本压缩包至云托管。"
    },
    {
      "section": "使用约束",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-cloudhost-uploadversion-0000001211707813#section5230614",
      "text": "在获取上传地址时响应的请求头中，“Authorization”参数的token有效期为30分钟。"
    },
    {
      "section": "响应参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-cloudhost-uploadversion-0000001211707813#section25434396",
      "text": "成功上传后会返回 “200 OK HTTPS” 响应，无响应体。"
    },
    {
      "section": "响应参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-cloudhost-uploadversion-0000001211707813#section25434396",
      "text": "上传失败响应内容："
    }
